   519	## A9.8 The number rule, for the V1 profile — OWNER DECISION (ENCODING-V1 D-1); supersedes rows 22–23
   520	
   521	prereg §4.3 and A1 P8 reject a number not exactly representable as an IEEE 754 double. That rule does not compose
   522	with RFC 8785: it accepts inputs whose canonical form it then rejects (ENCODING-V1 §1.2). For `tessera-v1-strict`
   523	it is replaced by: **accept a number exactly when RFC 8785's canonical serialization preserves its value; reject
   524	otherwise.** Proof: `formal/p8/PROOF.md` Lemma 3. Vectors: `formal/p8/vectors/`.
