   298	**The cut order, as registered.** A9:211-213: "If the 30 Oct exit slips, the first item cut is the PQ hybrid (the
   299	registered fallback is then taken), and nothing else is on the list: the signature-inclusive anchor `A_sig`, the
   300	root-KSK rule and the git stamp target (D-16) are required."
