   302	As amended by A10 row 33 (A10:769), "and nothing else is on the list" becomes: "the second item cut is the
   303	service-key listing (A10.4.1). If it is cut while A9.5's independent release boundary is established, A10.4
   304	option (a) applies and the absence of new-key protection is stated. Cutting it does not cure a failure of
