   102	## 6. What the tester does (4 December)
   103	
   104	One independent tester, who meets the criteria in `docs/V1-TESTER-BRIEF.md`, takes a receipt bundle and the
   105	verifier release and runs the verifier. For each case in A9.1's scenario mapping, the tester decides from the
   106	documentation alone whether to rely on the receipt, with no help from the project. **Pass:** no unsafe accepts,
   107	and false rejects only on d2 and h. The result is that one tester's result.
