  1232	### 15.1 Container [OWNER 2026-10-14, G14, G17, G33]
  1233	
  1400	  - A commit whose `tree` header names an id other than the SHA-1 id of `git.trees[0]` is `INVALID / GIT_PATH`
  1401	    (row 14.5); there is no dedicated code. [OWNER 2026-10-14, codified from diff-1, EA-22]
