  1403	  `INVALID / GIT_SHA1_COLLISION`. SHA-1DC is a pinned detection implementation and version named in the dependency
  1404	  manifest, with its prescribed collision-return behaviour, not whatever a library calls SHA-1 (section 14.2 item
  1405	  15). [OWNER 2026-10-14, r2-F14]
